{"id":"f2687d43de29f0d1","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-centralizing.md","title":"Centralizing","display":"df-centralizing — Centralizing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-centralizing","aliases":["93-df-centralizing"],"display":"df-centralizing — Centralizing","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-commutator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-centralizing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-centralizing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-centralizing — Centralizing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"18ca772ab524a46f\" href=\"?note=18ca772ab524a46f\" title=\"93-df-commutator\">93-df-commutator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\theta,\\phi]_{\\mathbf A}\">\\([\\theta,\\phi]_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> is their commutator.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> is the diagonal congruence and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Centralizes}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Centralizes}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}centralizing}\\vdash\\mathrm{Centralizes}_{93}(\\theta,\\phi,\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\land[\\theta,\\phi]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}centralizing}\\vdash\\mathrm{Centralizes}_{93}(\\theta,\\phi,\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\land[\\theta,\\phi]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Membership in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> supplies the algebraic typing, while the algebra parameter on the commutator prevents cross-algebra comparison.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-commutator","status":"resolved","id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-commutator]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"[\\theta,\\phi]_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Centralizes}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}centralizing}\\vdash\\mathrm{Centralizes}_{93}(\\theta,\\phi,\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\land[\\theta,\\phi]_{\\mathbf A}=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false}],"bytes":864,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["30b341bfbd8b5301","18ca772ab524a46f"]}